# .gitignore — dependencies & build / runtime state / local tools / local working files.
# Admission rule (docs/agents/dev-workflow.md §产物落盘规则): before adding an entry,
# ask "why is this product not in .scratch/?" Only runtime state and dependencies qualify.

# --- Dependencies & build ---
node_modules/
coverage/
test-results/
playwright-report/
dist/
build/
.cache/
.turbo/
.vite/
*.tsbuildinfo
*.timestamp-*.mjs
npm-pack-dry-run.json
*.tgz

# --- Runtime state ---
.amber/
.amber-test-interactive/
.harness/
.amber-legacy-harness-backup-*/
tests/.tmp/
output/
issues/

# --- Local tools ---
.codex/
.grok/
.mimocode/
.workbuddy/
.impeccable/
.qoder/
.playwright-cli/
.tanstack/
apps/web/screenshots/
apps/web/output/
.claude/settings.local.json
.claude/worktrees/
.claude/plans/
.idea/
.vscode/
.DS_Store
Thumbs.db
Desktop.ini
*.sw[po]
*~
.env
.env.*
!.env.example
.npmrc

# --- Local working files ---
.scratch/
agent-tools/
terminals/
.archive/
test-reports/
test-workflows/
spec-compliance*/
tests/fixtures/worktree-test-repo/
# F063: these docs/ namespaces moved to .scratch/ (untracked); the entries stay
# so a recreated docs/research or docs/legacy can never sneak into a commit.
docs/research/
docs/legacy/
*.log
notes.md
.release-checklist.md
session-handoff.md
tasks/
问题清单.md
